config PINCTRL_HI3519DV500
	tristate "HiSilicon Hi3519DV500 SoC pinctrl driver"
	depends on OF
	depends on ARCH_HISI || COMPILE_TEST
	select GENERIC_PINCTRL_GROUPS
	select GENERIC_PINMUX_FUNCTIONS
	select GENERIC_PINCONF
	help
	  Say Y to select the pinctrl driver for the HiSilicon Hi3516DV500
	  and Hi3519DV500 SoCs. The pin controller allows selecting the
	  mux function of each
	  pin and configuring its bias, drive strength and slew rate.
	  This driver can also be built as a module called
	  pinctrl-hi3519dv500.
